  "reasoning": "The defendant operated a breakfast shop and mistakenly added a toxic substance (nitrite) to food, causing multiple people to be poisoned and one death. This constitutes the illegal production and sale of toxic or harmful food, which under Chinese criminal law is charged as ‘生产、销售有毒、有害食品罪’. The act is not a fire, accident, or sexual crime, but a food safety offense leading to death.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]生产、销售有毒、有害食品罪<eoa>"
